## Rules for All Components

- Never overwrite a field another component owns
- Always set `status` after finishing your write — this is how the next component knows to pick up the record
- If your workflow fails, set `status = error` and log the reason in an `error_notes` field if available
- Test against the shared base, not a personal copy

---

The most important parts are the status values and the "Written By" column in each table — those two things are what prevent teammates from accidentally overwriting each other's work or building workflows against field names that don't exist yet.
